 searching for a highly motivated and experienced educator to provide dynamic leadership for the Writing Center. View Details Bookmark Director of Procurement & Contract Services STAFF - VA - 27060 University Business Services - Financial Services Procurement Services Staff Montana State University is seeking a strategic and collaborative leader to serve as Director of Procurement and Contract Services. This role provides executive oversight of the university’s procurement function, contracts for goods and services, and guides the strategic use of the university procure-to-pay system (Jaggaer), collaborating across Financial Services to ensure an efficient and all... View Details Bookmark Senior Employee Relations Specialist STAFF - VA - 27077 Administration Employee & Labor Relations Staff Step into a critical, high-impact role at Montana State University as our Employee Relations Specialist, where your investigative expertise will directly drive the resolution of complex workplace challenges. We are seeking a principled professional to navigate sensitive personnel matters head-on, ensuring fair, compliant, and consistent practices through objective analysis and strategic leaders... View Details Bookmark University Human Resources Analyst STAFF - VA - 27073 Administration HR Comp Ben Empl Services Staff The University Human Resources (UHR) Data Analyst works closely with the Compliance Specialist, Service Center Director, and Payroll Director to ensure the accuracy, integrity, and efficiency of UHR Data. This position performs advanced data analysis, reporting, system maintenance, troubleshooting, and testing to support University Human Resources operations and strategic initiatives.The Analys... View Details Bookmark Customer Experience Coordinator STAFF - VA - 26286 Administration Parking Facility Staff The Parking Experience Coordinator serves as the primary customer service representative for MSU’s University Police – Parking and Transportation Services and is often the first point of contact for students, employees, campus visitors, and community members. This position provides customer support related to parking permits, citations, appeals, parking regulations, and account transactions whi... View Details Bookmark Custodian I - Part-Time - Pool STAFF - VA - 27083 Auxiliaries Residence Life Administration Staff Residence Life Custodians provide cleaning and light maintenance services for the residence halls and associated areas. This part-time position is for up to 16hours per week. View Details Bookmark Parking Enforcement Officer I STAFF - VA - 26211 Administration Parking Facility Staff Under the supervision of the Parking Enforcement Supervisor, Parking Enforcement Officers conduct foot and vehicle patrols of University parking lots in order to enforce campus parking regulations. Some of the duties will include: patrolling campus parking areas; issuing citations; use the T2 enforcement and parking management software; selling vehicle parking permits; providing information abo... View Details Bookmark Research Associate - Field Research Program STAFF - VA - 27082 College of Agriculture AES EARC Staff This position will work under the supervision of the Associate Professor of Plant Pathology at the Eastern Agricultural Research Center to manage and conduct field research projects focused on crop disease management and agricultural production systems. Responsibilities include establishing and maintaining research plots, collecting field data, managing research activities, performing data anal... View Details Bookmark Research Associate – Pulse Crop Survey Program STAFF - VA - 27081 College of Agriculture AES EARC Staff This position will work under the supervision of the Associate Professor of Plant Pathology at the Eastern Agricultural Research Center to coordinate and conduct a regional pulse crop pest and disease survey program. Responsibilities include surveying commercial fields, collecting and managing field data, communicating findings with producers and agricultural stakeholders, supporting outreach a... View Details Bookmark Lab Manager STAFF - VA - 27080 College of Agriculture Microbiology & Cell Biology Staff The Evans Lab in the Department of Microbiology and Cell Biology is seeking a highly skilled and motivated Research Lab Manager to conduct research activities and oversee lab functions. View Details Bookmark Director of Graduate Recruitment and Admissions STAFF - VA - 27079 Office of Research and Economic Development Graduate School Staff Join the Graduate School team to lead MSU’s graduate recruitment and admissions strategy, shaping the journey from prospect to enrollment. This role drives a dynamic, centralized approach to application processing, evaluation, and decision-making while enhancing the graduate student experience through impactful orientation programs. As a key partner to academic departments, the Director plays a... View Details Bookmark Livestock and Farm Assistant Manager STAFF - VA - 26440 College of Agriculture AES NARC Staff The employee will interact with research professionals, faculty, the Superintendent, and the Department Head in general support of the commodity production, research, and educational programs of the research center and the department. View Details Bookmark Laborer STAFF - VA - 27078 University Services Facility Services Staff Under general supervision of the Campus Maintenance Manager, the Laborer provides services to the University by performing, assisting and supporting the maintenance and care of buildings, grounds, equipment, and utilities. View Details Bookmark Agronomic Entomologist FAC - VA - 27009 College of Agriculture Plant Sciences Faculty Montana State University invites applications for a tenure-track Assistant Professor of Agronomic Entomology in the Department of Plant Sciences and Plant Pathology. The successful candidate will develop an innovative, externally funded research program addressing fundamental and applied questions in the biology, ecology, and management of insects in agricultural systems. The position offers op... View Details Bookmark Research Associate *Kalispell, MT* STAFF - VA - 27065 College of Agriculture AES NWARC Staff Montana State University’s Northwestern Agricultural Research Center (NWARC) is seeking a motivated and detail-oriented individual to support its field crop physiology research program. This role offers a unique opportunity to contribute to applied agricultural research that directly benefits farmers and agribusinesses in Northwest Montana. The successful candidate will be involved in hands-on ... View Details Bookmark Career Development Coordinator STAFF - VA - 27076 College of Education, Health & Human Development Dean Educ/HHD Staff The Career Development Coordinator oversees all activities related to career development within the LIFE Scholars program and works as an active member of the team to contribute to the overall mission of preparing graduates for meaningful, competitive, integrated employment. View Details Bookmark Academic Success Coordinator - Gianforte School of Computing STAFF - VA - 27051 College of Engineering Gianforte School of Computing Staff Serves as the program coordinator for the undergraduate and graduate programs in the Gianforte School of Computing. In this role, this person may perform course scheduling duties for the entire department. This person may also work with advisors to facilitate course registration. Additionally, this person may serve as the primary coordinator to the graduate students within the department and is... View Details Bookmark Equipment Operator II STAFF - VA - 27043 University Services Facility Services Staff The individual in this position will be a key player on the MSU Grounds/Waste team. Primarily focusing on waste, recycling and snow removal, this team player will complete a wide variety of duties in a great work environment. View Details Bookmark Postdoctoral Researcher - Lyme Disease Bacteriophage Biology STAFF - VA - 27075 College of Agriculture Microbiology & Cell Biology Staff The Secor Lab seeks a postdoctoral researcher to investigate bacteriophage biology in the Lyme disease spirochete Borrelia burgdorferi. The successful candidate will help define how phiBB-1 controls horizontal gene transfer and bacterial adaptation across the tick-mouse infectious cycle. View Details Bookmark Lead Systems Analyst STAFF - VA - 27055 VP for Information Technology UIT Enterprise Services Group CUF Staff Lead the Enterprise Service Group (ESG) Finance team to support the four-campus Banner Finance operations. Collaborate with business counterparts to establish project priorities, address reported issues, and maintain existing processes. View Details Bookmark Director of University News and Media Relations STAFF - VA - 27058 Others Reporting to the President University Communications Staff The Director of University News and Media Relations leads the MSU News Service and oversees Montana State University’s central news, media relations and public information functions. The position advances MSU’s reputation through accurate, timely and compelling storytelling; productive relationships with journalists; thoughtful public information planning; and coordinated communication during c... View Details Bookmark Extension Agent – 4-H Youth Development – Lewis and Clark County FAC - VA - 27007 Extension Extension Agents/Field Faculty This position is located in Helena, Montana.The primary duty for County Extension Faculty is to assess local community needs, then to develop, implement, and evaluate Extension programming to meet those needs. The primary emphasis of the Lewis and Clark County 4-H Youth Development Extension Agent position is in the area of 4-H Youth Development. The Lewis and Clark County Extension office is s... View Details Bookmark Extension Agent - Granite County FAC - VA - 27006 Extension Extension Agents/Field Faculty This position is located in Philipsburg, Montana.The primary duty for County Extension Faculty is to assess local community needs, then to develop, implement, and evaluate Extension programming to meet those needs. The primary emphasis of the Granite County Extension Agent position is in the areas of Agriculture, Natural Resources and 4-H Youth Development with secondary emphasis on Community V... View Details Bookmark Custodial Supervisor II STAFF - VA - 27074 Auxiliaries Residence Life Administration Staff View Details Bookmark CARC Administrative Associate III STAFF - VA - 27063 College of Agriculture AES CARC Staff The Administrative Associate III performs a variety of administrative support, personnel & payroll, and accounting duties for the Central Agricultural Research Center (CARC), located at Moccasin, MT. This includes providing administrative assistance to the superintendent and direct support for faculty and staff at the center. The Administrative Associate III represents CARC and its interest... View Details Bookmark Dishwasher - Full-TIme (Applicant Pool) STAFF - VA - 26425 Auxiliaries Culinary Services Administration Staff MSU’s Culinary Services hires motivated team members who are excited to actively participate in the ever changing world of the high-paced food industry. View Details Bookmark Subaward Manager STAFF - VA - 27053 Office of Research and Economic Development Office of Sponsored Programs Admin Staff The Subaward Manager represents a great opportunity in the Office of Sponsored Programs (OSP) for a dynamic candidate with exceptional multi-tasking and organizational skills. The individual in this position will provide direct financial and administrative support to the OSP Subaward area. View Details Bookmark Major Gifts Program Manager STAFF - VA - 27072 Museum of the Rockies Museum of the Rockies Staff The Major Gifts Program Manager at Museum of the Rockies is responsible for building, soliciting, and stewarding relationships with donors capable of making gifts of $10,000 or more. The position manages a portfolio of 70-100 donors and prospects, primarily in the Bozeman area, and is expected to meet fundraising goals that support the museum’s annual operations, capital projects, exhibitions, ... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor of Mechanical Engineering FAC - VA - 26032 College of Engineering Mechanical & Industrial Engineering Faculty The Mechanical & Industrial Engineering (M&IE) Department at Montana State University invites applications for a full-time, tenure-track position at the rank of Assistant Professor. The primary responsibilities include teaching both undergraduate and graduate courses focused in mechanical engineering, developing a sustained, commendable, distinguished, and externally-funded research pro... View Details Bookmark Training and Development Specialist STAFF - VA - 26419 Division of Student Success DISC Staff MSU Access and Success is seeking a Training and Development Specialist to support campus-wide initiatives that foster inclusive dialogue, effective communication, and community engagement. This position plays a key role in developing and delivering educational programming that enhances the ability of students, faculty, and staff to engage across differences and contribute to a welcoming and in... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 3 4 5 6 Next University Human Resources 920 Technology BLVD, Suite A Bozeman, MT 59718 406-994-3651 humanresources@montana.edu Accessibility | Contact List | Directories | Jobs | Legal & Privacy Policy | Site Index Montana State University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
