ed research pro... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor of Microbiology FAC - VA - 26143 College of Agriculture Microbiology & Cell Biology Faculty Assistant Professor of Microbiology View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor – Instruction and Open Strategies Librarian FAC - VA - 26141 Libraries Library Faculty This tenure-track librarian will focus on library open strategies and offer library instruction, including providing strategic direction across the library with open technologies, open research, open education and pedagogy, and scholarly communication; being a member of the library instruction department, offering credited and embedded instruction to students, staff, and faculty; and contributi... View Details Bookmark Assistant to the Director STAFF - VA - 26341 College of Nursing Montana AHEC/Rural Health Staff This position will support AHEC/MORH in conducting activities to align with the mission of the department by providing high-level administrative support to the Director while overseeing daily office operations to ensure an organized, efficient, and professional work environment. This role manages executive scheduling, travel, expense reconciliation, HR liaison responsibilities, recruitment coor... View Details Bookmark Assistant/Associate/Full Professor - Nursing FAC - VA - 26128 College of Nursing Nursing Departments Faculty The Mark and Robyn Jones College of Nursing is searching for Assistant/Associate/Full tenure-track faculty with primary responsibilities teaching both undergraduate and graduate courses in nursing, developing and/or sustaining a funded program of research, and participating in professional/service activities. View Details Bookmark Aviation Non-Tenure Track Faculty - Gallatin College (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26044 Gallatin College Gallatin College Faculty View Details Bookmark Bookkeeping and Business Management Non-Tenure Track Faculty - Gallatin College (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26040 Gallatin College Gallatin College