 teach courses to students that are focusing their education on Fish and Wildlife Management, Conservation Biology, Organismal Biology and Biological Sciences Education. Most courses taught in the department involve field trip components in the Greater Yellowstone Eco-system. The Ecology Department comprises the largest student population within MSU’s College of Letters and Scien... View Details Bookmark Global Health Non-Tenure Track Faculty (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 23083 College of Letters & Science Liberal Studies Faculty Housed in the Liberal Studies program, the Global Health minor allows students to develop an interdisciplinary understanding of health issues and health care in a global context. Through studying a broad range range of courses, this minor will be provided with a solid foundation in social, cultural, epidemiological, environmental, and nutritional determinants of health, and will explore the cha... View Details Bookmark Extension Agent - On Farm Irrigation - Flathead Reservation FAC - VA - 26009 Extension Extension Agents/Field Faculty This position resides at the MSU Flathead Reservation Extension Office in Polson, MontanaThe primary duty for MSU Flathead Reservation Extension Faculty is to assess community needs, then develop, implement, and evaluate Extension programming to meet those needs. The main emphasis of the MSU Extension Flathead Reservation Irrigation Efficiency Agent position will be to provide technical assista... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor of Mechanical Engineering FAC - VA - 26032 College of Engineering Mechanical & Industrial Engineering Faculty The Mechanical & Industrial Engineering (M&IE) Department at Montana State University invites applications for a full-time, tenure-track position at the rank of Assistant Professor. The primary responsibilities include teaching both undergraduate and graduate courses focused in mechanical engineering, developing a sustained, commendable, distinguished, and externally-funded research pro... View Details Bookmark Continuing and Professional Education Non-Tenure Track Faculty (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26037 Extended University Extended University Faculty Academic Technology and Outreach seeks non-tenure track faculty to teach non-credit courses in professional and personal development areas to include personal/professional finances, business leadership and development, science, technology, health and wellness, humanities, arts, and more. Instruction may take place in-person, online or in hybrid formats. Appointments are available throughout the... View Details Bookmark Gen Ed - Humanities Non-Tenure Track Faculty - Gallatin College (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26038 Gallatin College Gallatin College Faculty Gallatin College seeks non-tenure track faculty for Humanities courses within the AA/AS program. View Details Bookmark Construction Trades Non-Tenure Track Faculty - Gallatin College (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26039 Gallatin College Gallatin College Faculty Gallatin College seeks non-tenure track faculty for Construction Trades programs including HVAC-R, General Construction, and Plumbing. View Details Bookmark Bookkeeping and Business Management Non-Tenure Track Faculty - Gallatin College (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26040 Gallatin College Gallatin College Faculty Gallatin College seeks non-tenure track faculty for the Bookkeeping and Business Management program. View Details Bookmark Photonics & Laser Technology Non-Tenure Track Faculty - Gallatin College (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26041 Gallatin College Gallatin College Faculty Gallatin College seeks non-tenure track faculty for the Photonics & Laser Technology program. View Details Bookmark Networking/Cyber Security Non-Tenure Track Faculty - Gallatin College (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26042 Gallatin College Gallatin College Faculty Gallatin College seeks non-tenure track faculty for the Networking/Cyber Security programs. View Details Bookmark Interior Design Non-Tenure Track Faculty - Gallatin College (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26043 Gallatin College Gallatin College Faculty Gallatin College seeks non-tenure track faculty for the Interior Design program. View Details Bookmark Aviation Non-Tenure Track Faculty - Gallatin College (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26044 Gallatin College Gallatin College Faculty View Details Bookmark Allied Health Non-Tenure Track Faculty - Gallatin College (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26045 Gallatin College Gallatin College Faculty Gallatin College seeks non-tenure track faculty for the Medical Assisting and Health Information programs. View Details Bookmark Counseling Non-Tenure Track Faculty (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26046 College of Education, Health & Human Development Counseling Faculty The Department of Counseling seeks course instructors based on need and availability in the following areas:PracticumInternshipVariable content courses View Details Bookmark Education Non-Tenure Track Faculty (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26047 College of Education, Health & Human Development Education Faculty The Department of Education seeks course instructors in the following specialty areas:Teacher Education – Generalist (Curriculum Design, Assessment)Teacher Education – Science MethodsTeacher Education – Social Studies MethodsTeacher Education – English Language ArtsMathematics EducationEducational TechnologyEducational LeadershipAdult EducationHigher EducationCurriculum & InstructionLibrary... View Details Bookmark Instructor of Music Non-Tenure Track Faculty (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26048 College of Arts & Architecture Music Faculty The School of Music seeks qualified individuals to provide non-tenurable instruction in the following areas: applied music instruction, ensemble conducting, music theory, aural skills, keyboard skills, popular music, world music, music history, composition, music technology, and electroacoustic music. View Details Bookmark Instructor of Photography Non-Tenure Track Faculty (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26049 College of Arts & Architecture School of Film and Photography Faculty The School of Film & Photography seeks qualified individuals to providenon-tenurable instruction in the following areas: photography (analog and digital), photo history, and new media. View Details Bookmark Instructor of Film Non-Tenure Track Faculty (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26050 College of Arts & Architecture School of Film and Photography Faculty The School of Film & Photography seeks qualified individuals to provide non-tenurable instruction in the following areas in the School’s Film Option: film and related media studies, film and video production (all aspects), film industry, acting, directing, scriptwriting, production management, science communication, wildlife and nature filmmaking, and digital media. View Details Bookmark Developmental Math Non-Tenure Track Faculty - Gallatin College (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26051 Gallatin College Gallatin College Faculty Gallatin College seeks non-tenure track faculty for Developmental Math. View Details Bookmark Culinary Arts Non-Tenure Track Faculty - Gallatin College (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26052 Gallatin College Gallatin College Faculty Gallatin College seeks non-tenure track faculty for the Culinary Arts program. View Details Bookmark Developmental Writing Non-Tenure Track Faculty - Gallatin College (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26053 Gallatin College Gallatin College Faculty Gallatin College seeks non-tenure track faculty to teach Basic Writing Skills (WRIT 080), Developmental Writing (WRIT 095), College Writing (WRIT 101) and Effective Academic Practices (COLS 100) to MSU and Gallatin College students. View Details Bookmark Welding Technology Non-Tenure Track Faculty - Gallatin College (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26054 Gallatin College Gallatin College Faculty Gallatin College seeks non-tenure track faculty for the Welding Technology program View Details Bookmark Gen Ed - Natural Sciences Non-Tenure Track Faculty