ivity that will contribute to or challenge thinking about architecture as the Sch... View Details Bookmark Instructor of Architecture Non-Tenure Track Faculty (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26057 College of Arts & Architecture Architecture Faculty The School of Architecture seeks an instructor(s) qualified to teach one or more of the following courses in Environmental Design/Architecture depending upon available funding:Funding, Architectural Design Studios, Architectural Structures, Architectural Graphics, Graduate Level Elective Courses, Professional Practice, Building Construction, Sustainability, Research Methods, Theory, Environment... View Details Bookmark Instructor of Art Non-Tenure Track Faculty (Applicant Pool) FAC - VA - 26056 College of Arts & Architecture Art Faculty The School of Art seeks qualified individuals to provide non-tenurable instruction in the following areas:VISUAL LANGUAGE 2DVISUAL LANGUAGE 3DLANGUAGE DRAWINGCERAMICS, SCULPTUREPAINTING, METALSMITHINGGRAPHIC DESIGNART HISTORY View Details Bookmark Registered Dietitian Nutritionist STAFF - VA - 27052 Athletics Athletics Staff The Registered Dietitian Nutritionist (RDN) for Bobcat Athletics will assist 15 NCAA Division 1 sports programs and rodeo and spirit squad programs to provide nutrition counseling and medical nutrition therapy to individual student athletes, teams and coaches. This position reports directly to the Senior Associate Athletic Director for Student Services. View Details Bookmark Custodian I - Full Time (Applicant Pool) STAFF - VA - 27001 Auxiliaries Auxiliary Services Administration Staff Applications are being accepted for the custodial pool at MSU!There are a variety of shifts in these departments across the campus:Culinary ServicesSports FacilitiesStrand Union BuildingUniversity Student HousingFacilities ServicesStudent Wellness Center View Details Bookmark Civil Rights Investigator STAFF - VA - 27067 Others Reporting to the President Campus Civil Rights Staff Montana State